grammar pgn
# Complete games are document children. The record framer can therefore
# retain the grammar-validated prefix when a byte window ends inside a game.
records children game
node game group as game
node tag_pair group as tag
node tag_name text as name
node tag_string text as value
node san text as move
node result text as result
node variation group as variation
node comment text as comment
node line_comment text as comment
node nag text as annotation
node annotation text as annotation
